Third-party components
----------------------
Third-party dependencies are listed in package.json and keep their own
licenses. They are not part of the RustCuiTool source distribution and
are fetched by the package manager.

Item metadata in src/lib/cui/rust-items.json and
src/lib/cui/rust-item-catalog.json consists of factual item identifiers,
shortnames, display names and categories extracted from Rust game files.
Rust and its assets belong to Facepunch Studios; item icons are read from a
folder selected by the user and are not redistributed with this project.
